# fastlane, for the App Store listing (`.github/workflows/ios-listing.yml`).
#
# Pinned here, with the lock file beside it, so the upload that runs next month
# is the one that was checked this month: `deliver` talks to an API Apple
# changes, and a floating version is how a listing upload breaks with nothing
# in this repository having moved.
